header: "---\nname: jake-closer-win-back\ndescription: \"Win-Back. Brings back the deals that went quiet. Finds lost deals worth one more try (bad timing, budget, still thinking, no decision) once enough time has passed or on the date they asked you to come back, plus open deals that went silent after every follow-up, and writes one short, honest check-in from the reason it was lost. One win-back per deal, never to anyone who said no or unsubscribed. Use when the user says \\\"win back\\\", \\\"revive old deals\\\", \\\"follow up on lost deals\\\", \\\"who went quiet\\\", \\\"re-engage\\\", \\\"dead leads\\\", or once a week.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/closer-skill\n  upstream_skill: win-back\n  upstream_commit: 0b0107690e202010710a59eb7d0b47d331255e59\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
